WEBVTT

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:06.120
We welcome you to AI Confidence Academy.

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:12.240
There are periods in life when technology
enters the world and suddenly the

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:16.860
conversation around it becomes loud.
People start making predictions.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.360
Companies start shifting direction.
Friends and families start asking

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:21.860
questions.

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:27.180
Some people move quickly. Some people
pause. Some people look at the whole thing

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:32.540
and quietly wonder, where do I fit in? or
even begin. AI confidence

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:37.960
academy begins with that honest question.
This academy was not built on

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:43.040
the expectation that you already
understand technical terms. It was not

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:48.280
created to impress you with complicated
language or make you feel that you need to

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:53.720
speak in technical jargon or know prompt
engineering to belong. You can begin

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:58.960
with everyday language and the questions
you already have. It is created

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:03.920
for the person who wants to understand
what artificial intelligence is,

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:05.600
how to use it wisely,

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:09.960
and how to begin with a human-centered
approach without feeling rushed,

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:14.420
judged, or overwhelmed. The heart of ACA
is simple.

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:21.000
People come first. AI is the tool.
Confidence is the product.

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:26.860
That sentence matters because it keeps the
order right. The person comes

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:28.000
before the platform.

00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:33.940
The learner comes before the lesson. Life,
work, family, purpose,

00:01:34.380 --> 00:01:39.640
and the dignity of the human being come
before technology. AI may be powerful, but

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:45.100
it is not the center of this Academy. This
Academy is a door to your journey into AI.

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:50.880
It will help you understand AI in plain
language. It will show you how to

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:55.300
start a conversation with an AI tool. It
will help you ask better questions,

00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:58.360
check the answers, protect your privacy,

00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:04.360
and apply AI to everyday life in practical
ways. Throughout that learning,

00:02:04.580 --> 00:02:10.120
one principle remains clear. AI assists
humans verify.

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:15.740
It will also help you see where AI fits
into work, business, creativity, and

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:20.120
learning, with a clear understanding of
its possibilities and limitations.

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:22.940
You do not need to know everything today.

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:27.840
You do not need to master every tool. You
do not need to become a computer

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:33.240
scientist. You only need a starting place,
a clear path, and enough

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:38.700
practice to begin building confidence.
That is what this Academy is

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:43.280
here to provide. Confidence does not
arrive all at once. It grows through

00:02:43.280 --> 00:02:46.520
repeated, guided practice. Welcome to ACA.

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:48.430
We're glad you're here.

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:52.460
Hello, and welcome to AI Confidence
Academy.

00:02:53.220 --> 00:02:55.500
My path into AI began with curiosity.

00:02:56.440 --> 00:03:00.800
I started having conversations with
ChatGPT, and over time, those

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:03.460
conversations became part of my everyday
life.

00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:09.720
I gave my AI companion a name,
Bartholomew. I bring in questions, ideas,

00:03:10.280 --> 00:03:14.400
documents, and things I'm trying to
understand. Sometimes I need help thinking

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:18.440
through a business decision. Sometimes I
want a document explained in plain

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:23.480
language. Other times something catches my
attention and I simply want to learn more.

00:03:24.340 --> 00:03:28.620
I've used those conversations while
planning and building my home, considering

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:33.580
retirement decisions and working through
projects. As I shared more about my goals

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:38.140
and circumstances, the assistance became
more relevant to what I was trying to

00:03:38.140 --> 00:03:38.760
accomplish.

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:43.740
But I also learned that a useful
relationship with AI requires your

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:48.860
participation. You can interrupt. You can
say, that isn't what I meant.

00:03:49.320 --> 00:03:54.380
You can add information, question an
answer or change direction. And when a

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:59.500
question involves laws, finances, or
another important decision, you need to

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:04.440
check the answer against reliable sources.
A confident response still needs

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:05.090
verification.

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:10.520
That is something I wanted other people to
experience. the freedom to ask questions,

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:16.520
and explore what this tool could help them
do. You don't need a business plan or a

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:21.980
complicated assignment to begin, a passing
thought, an everyday problem, or a

00:04:21.980 --> 00:04:24.820
little curiosity can open the
conversation.

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:30.300
When Terrence saw how naturally I worked
with Bartholomew, it helped him see

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:35.740
possibilities for his own life. He went
home, began learning, and kept building.

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:40.420
What grew from that experience became
something we wanted to share through ACA.

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:45.120
We want people to feel comfortable
entering this space, asking their

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:50.040
questions and learning through practice.
Your experience and judgment belong

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:54.900
in the conversation. They help you
recognize what is useful, what needs

00:04:54.900 --> 00:04:55.600
clarification,

00:04:56.340 --> 00:05:01.440
and what deserves a closer look. Thank you
for taking the time to meet us. We look

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:05.960
forward to welcoming you into AI
Confidence Academy and helping you find

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:07.260
your own way forward.

